OL,3,ASix killed in Krakow 'far-right'
OL,4,Ashooting, as three more bodies found in
OL,5,Aattacker's home
OL,6,
OL,7,FA gunman believed to have been inspired
OL,8,Fby far-right ideology killed six and
OL,9,Finjured more than a dozen in Krakow on
OL,10,FSaturday.
OL,12,FPolice said the attacker drove onto
OL,13,FMain Market Square, the busy centre of
OL,14,FPoland's second largest city, and began
OL,15,Frandomly firing at people.
OL,17,FThe gunman, who was equipped with
OL,18,Fmilitary-style weapons and attire, was
OL,19,Fshot and subdued by police, one of whom
OL,20,Fwas critically injured in the process.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
